# Deploys run from the repo root because both projects set a Root Directory.
# Everything here is either rebuilt on Vercel or local-only; uploading it is what
# tripped the "more than 15000 items" and broken-symlink failures before.
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/.venv.nosync
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/.env.*
frontend/build
frontend/assets-raw
backend/tests
backend/emergentintegrations_stub
.git
